### Orvexa API v1 — journey step 08: governed AI
### One metered turn per invoke (token usage clamped to the configured cap;
### suggestions are advisory, never auto-executed) and tool execution through
### the allowlist gateway (schema + rate + audit).

@ORVEXA_URL = {{$processEnv ORVEXA_URL}}
@ORVEXA_KEY = {{$processEnv ORVEXA_KEY}}

### Runtime view of the agent configuration → 200
# @name aiAgentView
GET {{ORVEXA_URL}}/api/v1/ai/agents/{{registerAgent.response.body.$.data.id}}
X-API-Key: {{ORVEXA_KEY}}

###

### Invoke one governed turn → 200 {text, suggestion?, input_tokens, output_tokens, outcome}
# outcome ∈ completed|refused|timeout|failed — refusal over hallucination
# @name aiInvoke
POST {{ORVEXA_URL}}/api/v1/ai/agents/{{registerAgent.response.body.$.data.id}}/invoke
X-API-Key: {{ORVEXA_KEY}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "interaction_id": "{{createInteraction.response.body.$.data.ID}}",
  "user_message": "What is my balance?",
  "facts": { "plan": "pilot" }
}

###

### Execute a tool through the gateway → 200 {tool, executed, result?, reason?}
### ⚠ LIVE WIRE CONTRACT NOTE: the body binds to Go field names in this build —
### `Tool` / `InteractionID` / `Args` (snake_case `interaction_id` does NOT
### match and the request 422s) — diverging from api/openapi/orvexa-v1.yaml.
### Allowlist: get_customer | create_case | send_whatsapp (403 otherwise, 429
### when rate-capped; refusals are audited).
# @name aiTool
POST {{ORVEXA_URL}}/api/v1/ai/agents/{{registerAgent.response.body.$.data.id}}/tools
X-API-Key: {{ORVEXA_KEY}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "Tool": "get_customer",
  "InteractionID": "{{createInteraction.response.body.$.data.ID}}",
  "Args": { "customer_id": "{{createCustomer.response.body.$.data.id}}" }
}

###

### (Optional) other action enums for /calls/{id}/actions live in 09-calls.http
### and transfer needs a destination:
# POST {{ORVEXA_URL}}/api/v1/calls/{{placeCall.response.body.$.data.ID}}/actions
# X-API-Key: {{ORVEXA_KEY}}
# Content-Type: application/json
#
# { "action": "transfer", "destination": "+254700000000" }
